# Leave EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL unset during development. The app then calls port
# 5000 on the computer Metro is serving from, which works on a phone on the same
# Wi-Fi and keeps working when that computer's IP address changes.
# Set it only to override that choice:
#
# Android emulator:          EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:5000
# Phone on the same Wi-Fi:   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://<computer-LAN-IP>:5000
# Web browser:               EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
